        "slc_c56caab6894a0c76e6b4814ce3d50093e8810f6e00ac99a338a1066bcb2a65da"
      ],
      "text": "The architecture is a local pipeline: scan with .agentignore, build offline summaries and a Tree-sitter semantic graph, score files for the task, select by value per token, redact secrets at materialization, and cache a pack registry with block IDs."
    },
